### =====================================================================
### BO TEST API - Web hoc tieng Trung
### Mo file nay bang IntelliJ / WebStorm roi bam nut ▶ ben trai tung request.
### Cac request duoc sap theo dung THU TU LUONG, chay tu tren xuong.
### =====================================================================

@host = http://localhost:8080
@api = {{host}}/api/v1

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. XAC THUC
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------

### 1.1 Dang ky tai khoan moi
POST {{api}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "hocvien01@example.com",
  "username": "hocvien01",
  "password": "MatKhau@123",
  "displayName": "Học viên 01"
}

### 1.2 Dang nhap ADMIN -> luu token vao bien
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@hoctiengtrung.vn",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("adminToken", response.body.accessToken);
%}

### 1.3 Dang nhap DEMO -> luu token vao bien
# @name loginDemo
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@hoctiengtrung.vn",
  "password": "Demo@123"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token", response.body.accessToken);
    client.global.set("refreshToken", response.body.refreshToken);
%}

### 1.4 Thong tin tai khoan dang dang nhap
GET {{api}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 1.5 Cap nhat ho so
PUT {{api}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "displayName": "Học viên Demo",
  "avatarUrl": null,
  "nativeLanguage": "vi",
  "currentHskLevel": 2
}

### 1.6 Lam moi token (refresh token cu se bi thu hoi - rotation)
POST {{api}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### 1.7 Doi mat khau
POST {{api}}/me/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "Demo@123",
  "newPassword": "MatKhauMoi@123"
}

### 1.8 Dang xuat (thu hoi 1 refresh token)
POST {{api}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### 1.9 Dang xuat tat ca thiet bi
POST {{api}}/auth/logout-all
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. TU VUNG / HSK   (GET la public, khong can token)
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------

### 2.1 Danh sach chu de
GET {{api}}/topics

### 2.2 Chi tiet chu de theo slug
GET {{api}}/topics/chao-hoi

### 2.3 Danh sach tu vung - phan trang
GET {{api}}/words?page=0&size=20

### 2.4 Loc theo cap HSK
GET {{api}}/words?hskLevel=1&size=10

### 2.5 Loc theo chu de
GET {{api}}/words?topicId=2&size=10

### 2.6 Tim kiem (khop Han tu, pinyin hoac nghia tieng Viet)
GET {{api}}/words?q=hoc&size=10

### 2.7 Chi tiet mot tu (kem vi du + chu de)
GET {{api}}/words/1

### 2.8 Lay tu ngau nhien de luyen tap
GET {{api}}/words/random?count=10&hskLevel=1


### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. KHOA HOC / BAI HOC
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------

### 3.1 Danh sach khoa hoc
GET {{api}}/courses

### 3.2 Loc theo trinh do
GET {{api}}/courses?level=HSK1

### 3.3 Chi tiet khoa hoc theo slug (kem danh sach bai hoc)
GET {{api}}/courses/hsk-1-co-ban

### 3.4 Chi tiet bai hoc (noi dung + ngu phap + tu vung)
GET {{api}}/lessons/1

### 3.5 Ghi danh khoa hoc
POST {{api}}/courses/1/enroll
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3.6 Danh sach khoa hoc da ghi danh
GET {{api}}/me/enrollments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3.7 Cap nhat tien do bai hoc
PUT {{api}}/me/lessons/1/progress
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "COMPLETED",
  "progressPercent": 100
}

### 3.8 Tien do tong the cua khoa hoc
GET {{api}}/me/courses/1/progress
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3.9 Huy ghi danh
DELETE {{api}}/courses/1/enroll
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. QUIZ / KIEM TRA
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------

### 4.1 Danh sach bai kiem tra
GET {{api}}/quizzes

### 4.2 Loc theo khoa hoc
GET {{api}}/quizzes?courseId=1

### 4.3 Chi tiet de thi
### LUU Y BAO MAT: response nay KHONG chua isCorrect / correctText / explanation.
GET {{api}}/quizzes/1

### 4.4 Bat dau lam bai -> tra ve attemptId
# @name startAttempt
POST {{api}}/quizzes/1/attempts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

> {%
    client.global.set("attemptId", response.body.id);
%}

### 4.5 Nop bai
### Dap an chi la vi du - hay lay questionId / optionId that tu request 4.3.
POST {{api}}/me/attempts/{{attemptId}}/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "answers": [
    { "questionId": 1, "selectedOptionId": 1 },
    { "questionId": 3, "textAnswer": "是" }
  ]
}

### 4.6 Lich su lam bai
GET {{api}}/me/attempts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4.7 Xem lai ket qua mot lan lam bai (luc nay MOI lo dap an + giai thich)
GET {{api}}/me/attempts/{{attemptId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. FLASHCARD + SRS (on tap ngat quang SM-2)
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------

### 5.1 Danh sach bo the
GET {{api}}/decks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5.2 Loc bo the theo cap HSK
GET {{api}}/decks?hskLevel=1

### 5.3 Danh sach the trong bo
GET {{api}}/decks/3/cards?size=20

### 5.4 Dang ky hoc bo the (tao lich on tap - goi nhieu lan van an toan)
POST {{api}}/decks/3/subscribe
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5.5 Lay cac the DEN HAN on hom nay
GET {{api}}/me/srs/due?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5.6 Cham diem mot the
### rating: AGAIN (quen) | HARD (kho) | GOOD (nho) | EASY (de)
POST {{api}}/me/srs/review
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "flashcardId": 511,
  "rating": "GOOD"
}

### 5.7 Thong ke hoc tap
GET {{api}}/me/srs/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5.8 Tao bo the rieng
POST {{api}}/decks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bộ thẻ của tôi",
  "description": "Những từ tôi hay quên",
  "isPublic": false,
  "hskLevel": 1
}


### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. QUAN TRI (can ROLE_ADMIN - dung {{adminToken}})
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------

### 6.1 Them tu vung moi
POST {{api}}/admin/words
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "simplified": "苹果",
  "traditional": "蘋果",
  "pinyin": "píngguǒ",
  "pinyinNumbered": "ping2 guo3",
  "meaningVi": "quả táo",
  "meaningEn": "apple",
  "partOfSpeech": "danh từ",
  "hskLevel": 1,
  "topicIds": [6]
}

### 6.2 Them chu de
POST {{api}}/admin/topics
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slug": "the-thao",
  "nameVi": "Thể thao",
  "nameZh": "运动",
  "description": "Từ vựng về thể thao",
  "sortOrder": 20
}

### 6.3 Tao khoa hoc
POST {{api}}/admin/courses
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slug": "khoa-hoc-moi",
  "title": "Khóa học mới",
  "description": "Mô tả khóa học",
  "level": "HSK1",
  "published": false,
  "sortOrder": 10
}

### 6.4 KIEM TRA PHAN QUYEN: user thuong goi API admin -> phai tra 403
POST {{api}}/admin/topics
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slug": "khong-duoc-phep",
  "nameVi": "Không được phép"
}


### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 7. CAC TRUONG HOP LOI (kiem tra chuan RFC 7807 ProblemDetail)
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------

### 7.1 Khong co token -> 401
GET {{api}}/me

### 7.2 Token rac -> 401
GET {{api}}/me
Authorization: Bearer day-khong-phai-jwt

### 7.3 Khong tim thay -> 404
GET {{api}}/words/999999

### 7.4 Du lieu khong hop le -> 400 kem map "errors"
POST {{api}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "khong-phai-email",
  "username": "a",
  "password": "123"
}

### 7.5 Trung email -> 409
POST {{api}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@hoctiengtrung.vn",
  "username": "trungemail",
  "password": "MatKhau@123",
  "displayName": "Trùng email"
}
